57/uploads/origins/0d22415b-4cb9-4c44-ab53-b08ab2b71951?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2c17b4f696c9448d61b1b25373431068, https://si.imgix.net/b293a957/uploads/origins/0d22415b-4cb9-4c44-ab53-b08ab2b71951?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=15060aa3d2dc0278e0a557ec0eba58d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b293a957/uploads/origins/0d22415b-4cb9-4c44-ab53-b08ab2b71951?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=358e65692e274a8a4f41e1ef2929ab18 3x"}, "body": "I would like a scene of the mother and the daughter in a one sided argument.\n\u6bcd\u3068\u5a18\u306e\u4e00\u65b9\u7684\u306a\u8a00\u3044\u4e89\u3044\u306e\u30b7\u30fc\u30f3\u304c\u6b32\u3057\u3044\u3002\n\nThe mother is shouting at the daughter.\nThe daughter does not shout back, her face is neutral, but that makes the mother angrier. \n\u6bcd\u89aa\u304c\u5a18\u3092\u6012\u9cf4\u308a\u3064\u3051\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\n\u5a18\u306f\u6012\u9cf4\u308a\u8fd4\u3055\u305a\u3001\u7121\u8868\u60c5\u3060\u304c\u3001\u305d\u308c\u304c\u6bcd\u89aa\u3092\u3088\u308a\u6012\u3089\u305b\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\n\nThe real daughter died long ago. The doll replaced her.\nThe mother's grief has turned to anger.\nThe fake daughter thinks she is real enough.\n\u672c\u5f53\u306e\u5a18\u306f\u3068\u3063\u304f\u306b\u6b7b\u3093\u3067\u3044\u308b\u3002\u4eba\u5f62\u304c\u305d\u306e\u4ee3\u308f\u308a\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u6bcd\u89aa\u306e\u60b2\u3057\u307f\u306f\u6012\u308a\u3078\u3068\u5909\u308f\u3063\u305f\u3002\n\u507d\u7269\u306e\u5a18\u306f\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306f\u5341\u5206\u306b\u672c\u7269\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\n\nReference: \nhttps://catbox.moe/c/l3hcym\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/pvgqys.jpg\n\nThank you.\n\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/l3hcym", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@s